SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s1-set1', 'csharp_dotnet', 1, 1, 4, 'What is the difference between ==, Equals() and ReferenceEquals() in C#? What must you do if you override Equals, and how do records change this?', 'technical', 180, 'ReferenceEquals compares object identity; == is overloadable (reference equality by default for classes, value equality for strings and many structs); Equals is the virtual equality method. If you override Equals you must override GetHashCode consistently (equal objects must have equal hashes) or hash-based collections break. Records generate value-based Equals, GetHashCode and == over their members.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
