SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s1-set2', 'csharp_dotnet', 1, 2, 1, 'When would you use an array, List<T>, Dictionary<TKey,TValue>, HashSet<T> or Queue<T>? Give the typical time complexity of lookup and insert for each.', 'technical', 180, 'Array: fixed size, O(1) index. List<T>: dynamic array, O(1) index, amortised O(1) append, O(n) insert or search. Dictionary: hash table, average O(1) lookup and insert by key. HashSet: average O(1) membership and uniqueness. Queue: O(1) enqueue and dequeue for FIFO work. Choose by access pattern, not habit; mention that bad GetHashCode degrades hash collections.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
