SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s2-set1', 'csharp_dotnet', 2, 1, 2, 'What do records, init-only properties, the with expression and pattern matching switch expressions give you? When would you choose a record over a class or struct?', 'technical', 180, 'Records give concise immutable-friendly types with value equality, a readable ToString and non-destructive mutation using with; init-only setters allow object initialisers without later mutation; switch expressions with patterns (type, property, relational, list) express branching declaratively. Use records for DTOs, messages and value objects; classes for entities with identity and behaviour; structs for tiny value-like data.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
