SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s2-set2', 'csharp_dotnet', 2, 2, 1, 'Why is async void dangerous? Explain how calling .Result or .Wait() on a Task can deadlock in a UI or legacy ASP.NET context and how ConfigureAwait(false) relates to it.', 'technical', 180, 'async void cannot be awaited and its exceptions are raised on the synchronisation context and can crash the process; use it only for event handlers. Blocking on a Task while the awaited continuation needs the same single-threaded context (UI thread or classic ASP.NET request context) deadlocks. ConfigureAwait(false) in library code avoids resuming on the captured context, but the real fix is to be async all the way instead of blocking.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
