SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s2-set2', 'csharp_dotnet', 2, 2, 2, 'Compare awaiting several tasks one after another with Task.WhenAll. How are exceptions and cancellation handled, and what is the effect on total latency?', 'technical', 180, 'Sequential awaits take the sum of the durations, WhenAll starts everything and completes in about the time of the slowest. WhenAll surfaces the first exception when awaited (all are available on the Task.Exception AggregateException), so inspect the individual tasks if you need every failure. Pass one CancellationToken to all work and observe it so cancellation stops everything promptly; limit concurrency when starting thousands of tasks.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
