SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s2-set3', 'csharp_dotnet', 2, 3, 2, 'What are tiered compilation, ReadyToRun and Native AOT? What trade-offs do they bring for startup time, throughput and compatibility?', 'technical', 180, 'Tiered compilation first JITs quickly with light optimisation and re-JITs hot methods with full optimisation. ReadyToRun precompiles IL to native code to cut startup but still allows JIT. Native AOT compiles to a self-contained native binary with the fastest startup and smallest footprint, but restricts runtime reflection, dynamic code generation and some libraries, so it needs trimming-safe code.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
