SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s3-set1', 'csharp_dotnet', 3, 1, 3, 'Show how you would implement IDisposable and IAsyncDisposable correctly for a class that owns both managed and unmanaged resources. When is a finalizer needed?', 'technical', 180, 'Use the dispose pattern: Dispose() calls Dispose(true) and GC.SuppressFinalize(this); Dispose(bool disposing) releases managed disposables only when disposing is true and unmanaged resources always; make it idempotent. Add a finalizer only if the class directly owns unmanaged handles (preferably wrapped in SafeHandle). Implement IAsyncDisposable with DisposeAsyncCore for asynchronous cleanup and use await using.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
