SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s3-set2', 'csharp_dotnet', 3, 2, 2, 'A legacy service randomly hangs under load because of sync-over-async code (.Result on Tasks). How do you diagnose it and what is the long-term fix?', 'scenario', 180, 'Symptoms: thread pool starvation, requests queued with low CPU. Diagnose with dotnet-dump or dotnet-stack to see many threads blocked in Task.Wait or GetResult, and dotnet-counters for thread pool queue length. The durable fix is to make the call chain async end to end; short-term mitigations are increasing minimum threads, ConfigureAwait(false) in libraries and removing blocking hot spots.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
