SELECT 'backend-csharp_dotnet-s3-set2', 'csharp_dotnet', 3, 2, 5, 'How do you design cancellation and timeouts in a chain of async calls? Explain CancellationToken propagation, CancellationTokenSource.CreateLinkedTokenSource and cleanup.', 'technical', 180, 'Accept a CancellationToken in every async method and pass it down to I/O calls; check it in loops. Combine a caller token with a timeout using CreateLinkedTokenSource(token) plus CancelAfter, and dispose the source. Treat OperationCanceledException as an expected outcome, not an error, and make cleanup idempotent so partially completed work leaves a consistent state.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
