SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s1-set1', 'aspnet_core', 1, 1, 1, 'Describe the ASP.NET Core request pipeline. What is middleware, how do Use, Run and Map differ, and why does the order of UseRouting, UseAuthentication and UseAuthorization matter?', 'technical', 180, 'The pipeline is a chain of middleware delegates; each can act before and after the next one and can short-circuit the request. Use passes control on, Run terminates the pipeline, Map branches by path. Order matters: routing must select the endpoint first, authentication must establish the user, and authorization then evaluates the endpoint policy, so a wrong order leaves endpoints unprotected or breaks identity.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
