SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s1-set2', 'aspnet_core', 1, 2, 3, 'What is a DbContext in Entity Framework Core? What lifetime should it have in a web app, and what do change tracking, AsNoTracking and SaveChanges do?', 'technical', 180, 'DbContext is a unit of work and a session with the database that tracks entities and translates LINQ to SQL. It is not thread-safe and is registered Scoped, one per request. Change tracking detects modified entities so SaveChanges writes one transaction; AsNoTracking skips tracking for read-only queries and is faster with lower memory use.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
