SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s1-set2', 'aspnet_core', 1, 2, 4, 'What is the N+1 query problem in EF Core? Compare Include, lazy loading, explicit loading and projection with Select, and say when AsSplitQuery helps.', 'technical', 180, 'N+1 happens when loading a list triggers one extra query per item (often via lazy loading in a loop). Include loads related data with joins, projection with Select fetches only the columns needed and is usually the best, explicit loading is manual, lazy loading hides the cost. Large Includes of collections can produce huge cartesian joins, which AsSplitQuery avoids by issuing separate queries.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
