SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s1-set3', 'aspnet_core', 1, 3, 1, 'Explain authentication versus authorization in ASP.NET Core. Compare cookie authentication with JWT bearer tokens and describe roles, claims and policies.', 'technical', 180, 'Authentication establishes who the user is; authorization decides what they may do. Cookies suit server-rendered apps in a browser (with CSRF protection); JWT bearer tokens suit APIs and mobile or SPA clients. A ClaimsPrincipal holds claims; roles are a claim type; policies combine requirements and handlers for richer rules, applied with [Authorize(Policy = "...")].', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
