SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s1-set3', 'aspnet_core', 1, 3, 5, 'How do you host an ASP.NET Core app in production? Explain Kestrel behind a reverse proxy such as IIS, Nginx or a cloud load balancer, forwarded headers, HTTPS and HSTS, and packaging with Docker.', 'technical', 180, 'Kestrel is the built-in server and is commonly placed behind a reverse proxy for TLS termination, load balancing and static content. Use the forwarded headers middleware so scheme and client IP are correct behind the proxy, enforce HTTPS redirection and HSTS, and publish a self-contained or framework-dependent build, often as a multi-stage Docker image running as a non-root user.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
