SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s2-set1', 'aspnet_core', 2, 1, 1, 'Compare custom middleware, MVC filters and endpoint filters. Which would you use for logging, authorization, validation and response shaping, and why?', 'technical', 180, 'Middleware runs for every request and knows nothing about the selected action, ideal for cross-cutting concerns such as logging, correlation IDs, exception handling and compression. MVC filters run inside the MVC pipeline with access to action arguments, model state and results, good for validation, auditing and response shaping per action. Endpoint filters give minimal APIs the same idea. Use the narrowest scope that has the context you need.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
