SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s2-set1', 'aspnet_core', 2, 1, 4, 'How do hosted services and BackgroundService work? How would you run a queue-processing worker inside an ASP.NET Core app and ensure a graceful shutdown?', 'technical', 180, 'A BackgroundService runs ExecuteAsync for the lifetime of the host. For a queue worker use a Channel or an external queue, loop on the stoppingToken, create a scope per message, handle exceptions so the loop does not die, and respect the shutdown timeout so in-flight work completes or is safely retried. Consider a separate worker process for heavy workloads.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
