SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s2-set2', 'aspnet_core', 2, 2, 5, 'Compare IMemoryCache, IDistributedCache with Redis, response caching and output caching. What is a cache stampede and how do you prevent it?', 'technical', 180, 'IMemoryCache is per instance and fastest but not shared; IDistributedCache (Redis) is shared across instances; response caching follows HTTP headers; output caching in .NET 7 and later caches server-side with tags and policies. A stampede is many requests recomputing an expired key at once; prevent it with locking or single-flight loading, jittered expiry, stale-while-revalidate and pre-warming.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
