SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s2-set3', 'aspnet_core', 2, 3, 3, 'What is the ASP.NET Core Data Protection API and what breaks when you run several instances behind a load balancer without configuring it?', 'technical', 180, 'Data Protection encrypts cookies, antiforgery tokens and other payloads with keys from a key ring. With multiple instances or containers each generating its own keys, one instance cannot decrypt what another issued, causing random logouts and antiforgery errors. Persist and share keys (Redis, blob storage, database) and protect them at rest, and set a common application name.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
