SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s3-set1', 'aspnet_core', 3, 1, 1, 'Compare Clean Architecture, onion and vertical slice organisation in ASP.NET Core. Where do MediatR and CQRS help or hurt, and how do you keep the domain free of framework dependencies?', 'architecture', 180, 'Layered styles put domain at the centre with application, infrastructure and web on the outside and dependencies pointing inward; vertical slices group code by feature to reduce cross-layer churn. MediatR and CQRS add a clear request and handler model and cross-cutting pipelines, but also indirection and ceremony for simple CRUD. Keep domain types free of EF, HTTP and DI attributes by using interfaces and mapping at the edges.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
