SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s3-set1', 'aspnet_core', 3, 1, 2, 'Design a multi-tenant SaaS API in ASP.NET Core. How do you resolve the tenant, isolate data (database per tenant, schema per tenant or tenant column) and use EF Core global query filters safely?', 'architecture', 180, 'Resolve the tenant from the subdomain, header or token claim in middleware and make it available through a scoped service. Isolation options trade cost against safety: database per tenant is strongest, a shared database with a TenantId column is cheapest. EF global query filters add the tenant predicate automatically, but you must prevent bypass (IgnoreQueryFilters, raw SQL), test isolation and consider row-level security.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
