SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s3-set1', 'aspnet_core', 3, 1, 5, 'A team of ten is building a new product on .NET. How do you decide between a modular monolith and microservices, and when would you choose gRPC or messaging instead of REST between services?', 'architecture', 180, 'Start with a modular monolith with clear module boundaries and in-process contracts, since microservices add operational and consistency costs that a small team rarely benefits from early. Split out services when scaling, team autonomy or deployment independence demand it. gRPC suits low-latency internal calls with strong contracts; messaging (Service Bus, RabbitMQ, Kafka) suits asynchronous workflows and decoupling; REST suits public APIs.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
