SELECT 'backend-aspnet_core-s3-set3', 'aspnet_core', 3, 3, 1, 'Your API returns timeouts and 500 errors only under heavy load while CPU stays low. Diagnose thread pool starvation: what signs do you look for, which tools do you use and what are the fixes?', 'scenario', 180, 'Low CPU with growing request latency and queue length points to blocked threads. Use dotnet-counters (thread pool queue length, thread count), dotnet-stack or dumps to find threads blocked on .Result or .Wait or synchronous I/O. Fix by making the code async end to end, removing blocking calls, bounding concurrency to dependencies and only as a stopgap raising the minimum thread count.', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
