SELECT 'aspnet_core', 1, 1, 'What is middleware in ASP.NET Core and how does the request pipeline work? Why does the order of middleware matter?', 'technical', 180, 'Middleware are components that form a pipeline; each handles the request, calls the next one and can act on the response on the way back. Order matters because each component sees the request only after the earlier ones: for example, authentication must run before authorization and exception handling should be first so it wraps everything.', 'document', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
