SELECT 'aspnet_core', 1, 2, 'Explain dependency injection in ASP.NET Core and the lifetimes Transient, Scoped and Singleton with an example of each.', 'technical', 180, 'The built-in container creates and supplies services, which are registered in Program.cs. Transient: a new instance every time (lightweight helper). Scoped: one per HTTP request (DbContext). Singleton: one for the whole app (configuration or a cache). Injecting a scoped service into a singleton is a bug.', 'document', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
