SELECT 'aspnet_core', 1, 3, 'What does the Program.cs file do in a modern ASP.NET Core app, and how does the minimal hosting model differ from the older Startup class?', 'technical', 180, 'Program.cs creates the WebApplication builder, registers services, builds the app and configures the middleware pipeline and endpoints, then runs it. The older style split this into Program and Startup (ConfigureServices and Configure); .NET 6 merged them into one file with top-level statements.', 'document', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
