SELECT 'aspnet_core', 1, 4, 'How does routing work in ASP.NET Core? Compare controllers with attribute routes and minimal API endpoints.', 'technical', 180, 'Routing maps a URL and HTTP method to an endpoint. Controllers use attributes such as [Route] and [HttpGet] on action methods; minimal APIs map handlers directly with app.MapGet and app.MapPost. Both support route parameters and constraints; controllers add filters and conventions, minimal APIs are shorter and lighter.', 'document', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
