SELECT 'aspnet_core', 2, 1, 'How do you build a REST API with controllers in ASP.NET Core? Describe the [ApiController] attribute, ActionResult and the HTTP status codes you return.', 'technical', 180, 'Create a controller class with [ApiController] and route attributes, and actions that return ActionResult<T>. Return 200 for success, 201 Created with the new location, 204 for no content, 400 for invalid input, 401 and 403 for authentication and authorisation failures, and 404 when not found. [ApiController] adds automatic validation responses and binding inference.', 'document', NULL, NOW(), NOW() FROM DUAL
